column58:
{{(lib)hwinfo-v12}} dropped support/recognition of OS-11-only-supported devices (e.g., due to RAM constraints).

{{igel-usb-power-ctl}} was updated to use {{hwinfo-v12}}, but the OS-11-only devices were never removed.

Builds currently fail. Fix this.

List of affected devices:

* {{HWI_HARDWARE_IGEL_H850C}}
* {{HWI_HARDWARE_IGEL_H830C}}
* {{HWI_HARDWARE_IGEL_M340C}}

Actually, these are the only _supported_ devices in {{igel-usb-power-ctl}} to begin with, so this would make the program totally obsolete. We probably should rather drop the whole module.

