column58:
The Suspend power consumption for this device is ~3W when it should be ~1W. This is improved with 12.8 and the 6.17 kernel. 

h3. Task

Check the mainline kernel to see if we can backport something into our 6.12 kernel for 12.7. 

h3. Result

Found commit in mainline kernel which lowers power consumption for Suspend: “Add Arrow Lake U/H support to intel_pmc_core_driver”

Based on Ubuntu backport, we need 4 other commits in addition to make this work, so 5 in total (in this order):

* “Remove duplicate enum”: {{78eaf4d12d7c}}
** [https://git.launchpad.net/~canonical-kernel/ubuntu/+source/linux-oem/+git/noble/commit/drivers/platform/x86/intel/pmc/arl.c?h=Ubuntu-oem-6.14-6.14.0-1016.16&id=203f04b762a67af6aec7c53d6ceb6c9a625e45cb|https://git.launchpad.net/~canonical-kernel/ubuntu/+source/linux-oem/+git/noble/commit/drivers/platform/x86/intel/pmc/arl.c?h=Ubuntu-oem-6.14-6.14.0-1016.16&id=203f04b762a67af6aec7c53d6ceb6c9a625e45cb]
* “Create generic_core_init() for all platforms”: {{ac6bef0d5401}}
** [https://git.launchpad.net/~canonical-kernel/ubuntu/+source/linux-oem/+git/noble/commit/drivers/platform/x86/intel/pmc/arl.c?h=Ubuntu-oem-6.14-6.14.0-1016.16&id=4123a1664811c965b8cf43d2cf974065d3b53e8c|https://git.launchpad.net/~canonical-kernel/ubuntu/+source/linux-oem/+git/noble/commit/drivers/platform/x86/intel/pmc/arl.c?h=Ubuntu-oem-6.14-6.14.0-1016.16&id=4123a1664811c965b8cf43d2cf974065d3b53e8c]
* “Remove simple init functions”: {{45fa1a0d4d87}}
** [https://git.launchpad.net/~canonical-kernel/ubuntu/+source/linux-oem/+git/noble/commit/drivers/platform/x86/intel/pmc/arl.c?h=Ubuntu-oem-6.14-6.14.0-1016.16&id=176840f99644d59a1ac776e7893d29f0b1dbdc1c|https://git.launchpad.net/~canonical-kernel/ubuntu/+source/linux-oem/+git/noble/commit/drivers/platform/x86/intel/pmc/arl.c?h=Ubuntu-oem-6.14-6.14.0-1016.16&id=176840f99644d59a1ac776e7893d29f0b1dbdc1c]
* “Add Arrow Lake U/H support to intel_pmc_core driver”: {{bd820906ea9d}}
** [https://git.launchpad.net/~canonical-kernel/ubuntu/+source/linux-oem/+git/noble/commit/drivers/platform/x86/intel/pmc/arl.c?h=Ubuntu-oem-6.14-6.14.0-1016.16&id=44db804982800348c70c759cd8a5e9e4c976322d|https://git.launchpad.net/~canonical-kernel/ubuntu/+source/linux-oem/+git/noble/commit/drivers/platform/x86/intel/pmc/arl.c?h=Ubuntu-oem-6.14-6.14.0-1016.16&id=44db804982800348c70c759cd8a5e9e4c976322d]
* “Fix Arrow Lake U/H NPU PCI ID”: {{f2eae58c4428}}
** [https://git.launchpad.net/~canonical-kernel/ubuntu/+source/linux-oem/+git/noble/commit/drivers/platform/x86/intel/pmc/arl.c?h=Ubuntu-oem-6.14-6.14.0-1016.16&id=8048576994b5152650a7364cd580019a6867d707|https://git.launchpad.net/~canonical-kernel/ubuntu/+source/linux-oem/+git/noble/commit/drivers/platform/x86/intel/pmc/arl.c?h=Ubuntu-oem-6.14-6.14.0-1016.16&id=8048576994b5152650a7364cd580019a6867d707]

