column58:
While working at [https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/browse/LX8-11355|https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/browse/LX8-11355|smart-link] I found, that libsecret contains the old password after a login it there was a password renewal at login time.

Testing with 12.7.3 I found:

* Missing password change at system logon
* Wrong password at libsecret after password change at login - currently not testable but the issue seems to be still in code, here a patch proposal:
* {noformat}diff --git a/window.c b/window.c
index e7659ac..0a00646 100644
--- a/window.c
+++ b/window.c
@@ -1391,7 +1391,8 @@ password_change_start_authentication (credential_tile_t *ct)
   message_add (ct->iggreeter, get_parameter (CHANGING), MSG_TYPE_ACTION, MSG_CATEGORY_ACTION, 1000, 0);
   tile_set_insensitive ();
   auth_change_password (ct->iggreeter, user, password_new);
-  g_free(password_new);
+  g_free(ct->iggreeter->password);
+  ct->iggreeter->password = password_new; // g_free(password_new);
   g_free(password_again);
 }{noformat}
The new password should replace the old one for future use.

