In the AVD logs during workspace download we see the following error message:

{{QObject: Cannot create children for a parent that is in a different thread.}}

This should be fixed to make sure everything works as designed.

In Teamcity we recently saw some

{{requests.exceptions.ConnectionError: ('Connection aborted.', RemoteDisconnected('Remote end closed connection without response'))}}

during calls to the app portal, for example when trying to get app information from the portal: {{app = self.app_portal.get_app(app_name, app_version)}}

The {{app_portal.py}} uses a plain {{requests.Session()}} without any timeouts or retries.

We should make this client more robust.

