12/Jun/25 5:20 PM;712020:c2f113c7-926b-43c8-9951-8fd54c1ca916;Please update similar [https://kb.igel.com/en/igel-os/11.10/troubleshooting-workaround-for-citrix-receiver-x-e|https://kb.igel.com/en/igel-os/11.10/troubleshooting-workaround-for-citrix-receiver-x-e|smart-link] KB document (for OS12) with following information.

h1. Troubleshooting: Workaround for Citrix Receiver X Error

h2. Problem

When starting Citrix resource you get the following Citrix Receiver errors on your IGEL OS devices:

{{The X Request 20.0 caused error: "3: BadWindow (invalid Window parameter)"}}

{{The X Request 55.0 caused error: "9: BadDrawable (invalid Pixmap or Window parameter)"}}

{{The X Request 60.0 caused error: "13: BadGC (invalid GC parameter)".}} 

h2. Solution

Add values in IGEL Setup under the following:

# Go to *System > Registry > app > cwa > wfclient > thinwire30 > ignorexerrors*.
# Activate *IgnoreXErrors* and pass the parameters: {{20.0/3, 55.0/9, 60.0/13}}



Please refer comment below for more information.

